  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"732c8d45-6688-449a-a09d-b7c0d36a705e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Compatibility</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>Please note that the following documentations are relevant only for OpenERP 7. From Bahmni 0.92 onwards, we use Odoo v10.</p><p>OpenERP 7 is still workable with rest of Bahmni 0.92, but requires some work and configuration. Please refer to <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900530355/ERP+FAQs+Troubleshooting\">FAQ</a> section</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"excerpt\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c8fd29b2-0b8c-4cde-9c9b-de548b9f26f0\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"atlassian-macro-output-type\">INLINE</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with OpenERP&nbsp;which is a an open source ERP product. It is useful in Billing, Pharmacy and Stock management. Any patient registered in OpenMRS is synced by Bahmni as a customer in OpenERP.&nbsp; </span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Below is a list of available Bahmni ERP modules.</span></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"ebf7312d-2b54-43c2-9ed5-b31db088984e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">List of Bahmni ERP Modules</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"01dc3a2d-c881-4e94-8c2b-84e7afd86e90\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"excerptType\">simple</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
