    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"732c8d45-6688-449a-a09d-b7c0d36a705e\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Compatibility</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Please note that the following documentations are relevant only for OpenERP 7. From Bahmni 0.92 onwards, we use Odoo v10.</p><p>OpenERP 7 is still workable with rest of Bahmni 0.92, but requires some work and configuration. Please refer to <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900530355/ERP+FAQs+Troubleshooting\" rel=\"nofollow\">FAQ</a> section</p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c8fd29b2-0b8c-4cde-9c9b-de548b9f26f0\" data-macro-name=\"excerpt\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with OpenERP which is a an open source ERP product. It is useful in Billing, Pharmacy and Stock management. Any patient registered in OpenMRS is synced by Bahmni as a customer in OpenERP.  </span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Below is a list of available Bahmni ERP modules.</span></p><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ebf7312d-2b54-43c2-9ed5-b31db088984e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>List of Bahmni ERP Modules</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"01dc3a2d-c881-4e94-8c2b-84e7afd86e90\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604219/Accounting+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604219\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Accounting Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014590/Pharmacy+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014590\" data-linked-resource-version=\"19\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Pharmacy Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115777052/Billing+Pharmacy+App\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115777052\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Billing/Pharmacy App</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014610/Inventory+Management+System\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014610\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Inventory Management System</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/116200817/Quotation+and+Invoices\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116200817\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Quotation and Invoices</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
